{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/500daa9c20770a474bfcda71c997db2d.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=285 /></span>In the beginning, various sightings\u00a0were reported of abnormal creatures roaming the countryside. Not long after, the creatures started to attack the villages and cities. Chaos quickly broke out as the packs of beasts grew to hordes. While the kingdoms are strained to survive, the mystery of who or what is behind this onslaught remains to be solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/96ee584be60826cbd78202e864af407f.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span>Tower Command is a roguelike tower defense with high level of strategy and tactics. Build towers to maximize bonuses and synergies to stop the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a commander, towers and traits to fit your strategy. Each tower is unique and can give bonuses to nearby towers, so place them wisely.   Try to survive as long as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/d458a4d6712a299fb37f6056ee53e55e.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span>All towers are unique. They vary in attack behavior, many have special passives and abilities and can give various bonuses to nearby towers. Gain experience and upgrade your towers to maximize their effectiveness. Combine upgrades and bonuses in effective ways to create crazy combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/4734543d2b5a73fc4f373f5aa3d82cc3.poster.avif?t=1767107769\" width=724 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/4734543d2b5a73fc4f373f5aa3d82cc3.webm?t=1767107769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/4734543d2b5a73fc4f373f5aa3d82cc3.mp4?t=1767107769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/e2e53ffda1d67ac365e8038f2234fa03.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span>Build your defense from by choosing from a wide range of unique towers. Stop the enemies from reaching their destination. Each map contains many waves, where each wave is unique. Enemies can have attributes and special abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/6818de923772924164e217b250fcb197.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span>Enemies have dynamic pathfinding, so there is no fixed path they take to their goal. Use this to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/5df75fa81a3e415eb22ecc02e73e8590.avif?t=1767107769\" width=954 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/092d703c312b9b2654d7991ea0c7e73a.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span>During the game, you gain experience and can use this to upgrade your towers with a wide range of upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/9ce3d079bfebb67b12f6218e09036e80.avif?t=1767107769\" width=936 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/fbe264794a325e194312eaaadc9d07f2.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span>Certain towers have link bonuses. These bones applies to nearby towers. Decide where to place your towers to maximize the damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/0c021a81a24a9802c0476c81c97b1444.avif?t=1767107769\" width=738 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/3daf32eca9bef8d8ba7270f16f73087a.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span>By playing you can complete various challenges to unlock new commanders, traits, towers and maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/1e86b5e4b1626584f732beff3c8282e0.avif?t=1767107769\" width=954 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/93a1f350e96cf05a73f284456a3f5f25.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span>There are multiple playable maps, each with a unique look and layout and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/ef5a265cb9cfa8ab7772bf6f57a96c6d.avif?t=1767107769\" width=954 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/7552acdde1df45fb33dbb8bd9c5d070a.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span>Choose a strategy and survive as long as possible! Each run is different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/c6dc2786d48416cc535593befa4442fd.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span>Each map has a final boss. But you can choose to keep playing after defeating this boss to continue in an &quot;endless&quot; mode where new waves will spawn to test how far you can really go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/50f8268bf688e8d767966d741f28fbef.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong>\u00a0AlkaKrab</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719660?t=1767107769","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719660?t=1767107769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/a2422b728f8ec706a1122bdf4fd091b6f4c82526/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767107769","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/a2422b728f8ec706a1122bdf4fd091b6f4c82526/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767107769","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descr