ith a unique look and layout and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/ef5a265cb9cfa8ab7772bf6f57a96c6d.avif?t=1767107769\" width=954 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/7552acdde1df45fb33dbb8bd9c5d070a.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span>Choose a strategy and survive as long as possible! Each run is different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/c6dc2786d48416cc535593befa4442fd.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span>Each map has a final boss. But you can choose to keep playing after defeating this boss to continue in an &quot;endless&quot; mode where new waves will spawn to test how far you can really go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/50f8268bf688e8d767966d741f28fbef.avif?t=1767107769\" width=1280 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong>\u00a0AlkaKrab</p>","developers":["RILE Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/842936e469c5c68c3b7450d56ddb25bbc58f7c37/header.jpg?t=1767107769","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>